     3,
     "<br>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Feb 26, 2009 at 5:26 AM, David Kahle <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">david...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div>Hi Marcus -<div><br></div><div>Give this a shot, I think it&#39;s what you&#39;re looking for (or something similar).</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px\">df<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> &lt;- </span>structure<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span>list<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span>Factor<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span>structure<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span>c<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">5</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">1</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">6</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">2</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">4</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">3</span>L<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">), </span>.Label<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span>c<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(156,34,17)\">&quot;a&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">,</span></div>\r\n<div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(156,34,17)\">&quot;b&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;c&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;d&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;e&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;f&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">class</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span>&quot;factor&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mean.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">8.8</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,79,30)\">3.6<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>40.3<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>14.7<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>8<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>24<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mean.2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span>5.8<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>1.2<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>32.4<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>7.1<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>5.5<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(156,34,17)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">8.7</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">)), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">.Names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span>&quot;Factor&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;mean.1&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">, </span>&quot;mean.2&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">row.names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\"> = </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(185,138,35)\">NA</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\">,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(156,34,17)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,79,30)\">6</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">L</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,27,147)\